  "node": {
    "id": "ctkg:v3e-object-78b080a6511445b11aa5e6e9",
    "canonicalType": "KnowledgeStatement",
    "label": "1. 确定增益 K 以满足误差或带宽要求。2. 计算未校正系统的相角裕度 PM。3. 考虑额外裕量（约 10°）并确定所需的最大相位超前角 φmax。4. 根据式 (6.40) 或图 6.53 确定 α。5. 选取截止频率处的 ωmax；零点位于 ωmax√α，极点位于 ωmax/√α。6. 绘制校正后的频率响应曲线并检验相角裕度 PM。7. 迭代设计；必要时采用双超前校正。",
    "aliases": [],
    "description": "1. Determine gain K to satisfy error or bandwidth requirements. 2. Evaluate PM of uncompensated system. 3. Allow for extra margin (~10°) and determine needed phase lead φmax. 4. Determine α from Eq. (6.40) or Fig. 6.53. 5. Pick ωmax at crossover frequency; zero at ωmax√α, pole at ωmax/√α. 6. Draw compensated frequency response and check PM. 7. Iterate on design; add double-lead if necessary.",
